    "message": "Skip already-published versions when resuming a publish\n\nRegistry metadata can be cached for minutes after a publish, so a resumed\nrun diffed phar against 0.1.0 and tried to republish 0.2.0 (E403). Check\nname@version with --prefer-online first, and diff with fresh metadata.",
